{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559990/extras/topper.png?t=1768745135\" /></span><strong>Embrace the Sin of Wrath</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For your sins in life you are condemned to an eternity of torture in the 5th circle of hell, but all is not as it seems. Sinners walk free across the fiery landscape committing acts of violence in the name of the Arch angel. Many have come to accept this new way of being and others seek to rip it down while you just want to get out and will kill anyone standing between you and that goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sinweaver is a combat focused metroidvania that offers lovingly hand crafted  levels, tied together with a secret packed overworld. Delve into time forgotten angelic ruins, writhing bestial caves and Fortresses dedicated to the fallen Arch angel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559990/extras/d38af7bc9961808f8fbdbdfa44f4e701.poster.avif?t=1768745135\" width=708 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559990/extras/d38af7bc9961808f8fbdbdfa44f4e701.webm?t=1768745135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559990/extras/d38af7bc9961808f8fbdbdfa44f4e701.mp4?t=1768745135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559990/extras/break.png?t=1768745135\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through slaughter you gain power. Level up with powerful upgrades and exciting new abilities scattered across the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call upon and channel the raw power of Sin and unleash devastating magic\u00a0to press your advantage in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve your path through brutal combat encounters and challenging platforming trials to uncover the dark origins of this infernal place and understand how Hell became so twisted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559990/extras/bda4d172241a7b34110774e10f4a682b.poster.avif?t=1768745135\" width=1170 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559990/extras/bda4d172241a7b34110774e10f4a682b.webm?t=1768745135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559990/extras/bda4d172241a7b34110774e10f4a682b.mp4?t=1768745135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559990/extras/break.png?t=1768745135\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 11 hand crafted levels, each capped off with a formidable boss</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Hand animated characters and creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Unique player abilities each with their own visual flare</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Explorable overworld packed with secrets and lore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559990/extras/bottom.pn